title: can be viewable from the mentioned via sourceward trees
pid: 7228b29f-d6b6-47d8-a553-cffad4fca4db
body: |2-
  The mentioned are the link targets.
  For instance, in this presentation forest:
  #+begin_example
  - X
  -- X1
  -- X2
  - A
  -- X', which links to X
  --- X1', which links to X1
  --- AX1
  #+end_example
  the fact that something is "talking about X" is visible in X's heralds:
  #+begin_example
  - 1/1L X
  #+end_example

  and the way things are talking about X can be shown in
  mentionarward (link-sourceward) views:
  - X
  -- La A
  -- Y
  --- bC La Y'
  -- Z
